{"sections":[{"slug":"几何态射的性质","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"几何态射的性质"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">几何态射的性质</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“几何态射的性质”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $f\\colon \\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何态射</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th><span lang=\"zh\">名称</span></th><th><span lang=\"zh\">范畴论定义</span></th><th><span lang=\"zh\">逻辑定义</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><span lang=\"zh\">开映射</span></td><td>$f^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Heyting <span lang=\"zh\">函子</span></td><td>$f^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持任意量词</span> $\\forall$</td></tr>\n<tr><td><span lang=\"zh\">嵌入</span></td><td></td><td>$f_*$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持任意量词</span> $\\forall$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}]}}}]}